example:
订单的本地事务先结束，再同步预留。锁定在自己的事务里改数量：

```java
public String place(String orderId, String skuId, int qty, String idemKey) {
  orders.insertPending(orderId, skuId, qty);
  LockResult locked = locks.reserve(orderId, skuId, qty, idemKey);
  if (locked == LockResult.REJECTED) {
    orders.markFailed(orderId);
  }
  return orderId;
}
```

```java
@Transactional
public LockResult reserve(String orderId, String skuId, int qty, String idemKey) {
  if (seen(idemKey)) return LockResult.RESERVED;
  int updated = stock.reserveIfEnough(skuId, qty);
  if (updated == 0) return LockResult.REJECTED;
  remember(idemKey, orderId, qty);
  return LockResult.RESERVED;
}
```

```sql
UPDATE stock
   SET available = available - ?,
       reserved = reserved + ?
 WHERE sku_id = ? AND available >= ?;
```

`insertPending` 的事务在 `reserve` 之前结束。`reserveIfEnough` 和 `remember` 在锁定库的另一次提交里。`place` 不调用支付服务，也不调用消息服务。
